<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH SKODA Q1 OUTPUT RISES 18 PCT YR/YR.</title>
<headline>CZECH SKODA Q1 OUTPUT RISES 18 PCT YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Skoda Automobilova a.s., the Czech unit of Volkswagen AG, said on Tuesday that first quarter output rose 18 percent year-on-year to 82,734 units.</p>
</text>
